WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.370
Closing time.

2
00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.410
A small shop is switching
on its new alarm.

3
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:10.410
It has three inputs: a door sensor,
a window sensor and an armed switch.

4
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.090
Each one is either on or off.

5
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:18.170
Before it goes live, the engineer
wants to test every possible situation.

6
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.750
So how many different cases is that?

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.690
Three, one per sensor?

8
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.910
Or more?

9
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.250
In this mission, you'll join several
conditions into one logic statement,

10
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.850
using AND, OR, NOT and brackets.

11
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.250
You'll turn a word
problem into a statement,

12
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.630
by giving each condition a letter.

13
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.570
And you'll build a truth table
with a column for each input.

14
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.560
Your mission: work out how many
cases the engineer must test.
